{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50863","headline":"省题诗二十一首 月前菊 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 月前菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋菊近重阳，原头复道旁。\n藂滋寒露绿，花绽晚风黄。\n蘖染枝枝艳，星分处处芳。\n乍疑金散野，遥误叶经霜。\n篱下何人采，罇中满座香。\n唯应未归客，对此欲沾裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}